  "conclusion": "The installed original 2013 and 2014 T1 E11 resources bind the six requested semantic rows to serialized production-column field IDs 150/236/260/420/484/485. This is stronger than printed labels alone: independent DTFORM numeric objects and DTFIELD records agree exactly on IDs and coordinates.",
  "limitations": [
    "The proprietary KJD container is unsupported by REA open_binary; this evidence is a format-aware offline byte parser, not vendor runtime observation.",
    "REA process capture also rejected this native Windows host because it cannot verify descendant cleanup. No genuine REA success Evidence ID is claimed for the parser run.",
    "DTFORM/DTFIELD layouts are derived from exact bounded structures and cross-file agreement; no claim is made to decode all property semantics.",
    "The five columns are structurally established; the vendor runtime selector tuple (0,1,-1) is not independently decoded by this resource parser.",
    "Year association is corroborated by a current-tax-year instruction in another form inside each same package, plus explicit DTMAXT1 XML YEAR metadata. E11 itself has a YEAR placeholder; no native year-loader call was analyzed.",
    "The 2013 container has two duplicate unrelated directory names (WSAE/WSAF); selected E11E/E11H and year-reference resources are unique and unambiguous.",
    "This establishes original form bindings, not complete extraction correctness, tax approval, return calculation or filing.",
    "No pending hosted mapping state was changed."
  ]
